--	Last update by Jane 98/1/16/
--	    Change exp_gain need fight with high exp NPC. since players get exp
--	    too easy now.
--	Last update by Jane 97/12/11
--	1). death will lost 5% exp
--	2). PKer will get -1% of victim exp
--
--	Last update by Jane 97/11/17
--      1).If some one use 暗器, and the victim don't learn 听风辩器, his 
--         pp  and dp is only 1/3 of origial one.
--      2).斗转星移 can parry as the tlbb book says. 能将敌人的招式反过来打
--         敌人自己. 但不能对付 暗器 和 六脉神剑
--      3).If some one is using sword, he can only enable parry with sword-skill
--         or unarmed-skills. the system will change the parry automatically.
--         see the function check_valid_parry_skill() in the file
--         /feature/skill.c
--
-- last update by Jane 97/11/5
-- add kee_fact, in skill_power(), "kee" will influence the exp just as "gin"
-- affect skill power
--
-- last update by Jane 97/11/2
--  1). if !living(victim). he will loss all actions 
--
-- last update by Jane 97/10/27
--  1). add 点穴 and hock and shears in the skill actions.
--  2). solve the high skill power become negative problem. see skill_power()
--
-- combatd.c last update from windf 15.6.97
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
